  "bio": "Malibu Budd, located in the heart of London, Canada, is a tattoo studio renowned for their exquisite black and gray, dark realism ink designs. With an aesthetic that embodies the edge of mortality, they extend their inking wisdom via two dedicated apprentices (@tattoos.by.kendall and @tattoos.by.pinky), ensuring the longevity of their unique craft. The studio, revealing an enthralling ambiance, breathes a respectful nod to the art of the eternal skin narrative.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: London, Ontario, Canada"
